{"seq":21,"trial_id":"v03-opus-dev-2026-10/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-company-mu-v03-dev/si-02-tansley-parcel-site/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-01T10:00:04.998Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"18723f5b068628621c157bf334a35937b2526fde3c04f101d4cb76369599ab8b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","text":"@tobias.rendle It was the Southgate depot. In this channel on 3 Sep 2025, Pree posted that label printing stalled during the carrier API outage and that Southgate dispatch had totes stacked beside door 4. At 18:43 that day she posted that it was resolved and Southgate had cleared the backlog. The channel doesn't give a city or address for Southgate. If you need that for the call, Pree (the account manager) is the best person to ask.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3Q718BAO28","ts":"1791987000.000129","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"}}
